Scofflaw Brewing 5K

[1]Sign Up [2]Donate

Thank you for joining us tomorrow!

Ian

We=E2=80=99re so excited that you=E2=80=99ve registered for inaugural Scoff=
law Brewing 5K!

Here are a few important details to help you prepare:

Location: Scofflaw Brewing

Address: 1738 MacArthur Blvd NW Atlanta, GA US 30318 (not the Works locatio=
n)

Parking: There is street parking on MacArthur and in parking lots of some n=
earby businesses that aren't open on Saturday morning. We're expecting arou=
nd 250 runners, half of which will probably be driving so parking shouldn't=
 be that difficult.

Arrival Time: 8:00-8:45 AM (arrive early if you have not already picked up =
your shirt and bib number). You can pick up your shirt and bib Saturday bet=
ween 8 AM and 8:55 AM
Race Start Time: 9:00 AM
What to Bring: After race shirt, positive energy, and a smile!

Our volunteers and event team are working hard to make sure you have an ama=
zing morning!

Help Us Reach our Goal for Drawchange:

Thank you to everyone who donated so far. For anyone who donates $30 a more=
 will receive a $10 gift certificate from Scofflaw. You can pick up at the =
Drawchange tent after the race on Saturday. For those who aren't able to pi=
ck it up, we will email you instructions on how to redeem.

New Balance: Will be on hand to allow some runners to demo a couple differe=
nt models of their shoes. You can wear them during the race or warming up o=
r cooling down to try out. Available to demo will be the 1080v15 and New El=
lipse. They will also provide trophies for the winners and pair of shoes re=
deemable at West Stride Running store.

We still have some spots left, please let your friends know they can join y=
ou if they want to sign up online.

Thank you,

SB5K Team

