awareness that their algorithms have become just too skillful at feeding me
content I will like so they can harvest my engagement.

But I did want to share with you guys a wonderful, near-perfect headline
from the Spanish newspaper El pa=C3=ADs: =E2=80=9CAmerican vertigo:  To the=
