il 13 to provide a peek behind the curtain of The Bulwark and preview our p=
lans for 2026. These twice-yearly updates are one of our ways of saying =E2=
=80=9Cthank you=E2=80=9D to founding members for their extra support.
Upgrade today to a Founding Membership and join us April 13.
We created the Founding Membership program to help fuel our growth and supp=
ort the mission of The Bulwark: to provide clarifying, stakes-focused cover=
age of the mayhem in Washington and elevate pro-democracy voices across the=
 internet. The extra support we receive from our Founders and Navigators he=
lps to fund new hires to deepen our bench of experts on topics like healthc=
are, economics, and national security.=20
