ached out to let us know that they love what we do but can=E2=80=99t afford=
 Bulwark+ access. That=E2=80=99s the easiest problem for me to solve nowada=
ys thanks to our paying subscribers, Founders, and Navigators: I give them =
a free subscription funded by this community.
Of course, we couldn=E2=80=99t do all this without the support of all our B=
ulwark+ members. Each membership advances our mission, and we heartily THAN=
K YOU for riding with us. Sarah said it best at the conclusion of our recen=
t show in Austin:
For those who want to do more to help further our growth, Founding Membersh=
ip is a high-impact option. It also comes with a few extra perks:
